  "title": "Tesla Cybercab Launch and Emergency Features in Response to Mass Shooting",
  "summary": "Tesla is set to launch its Cybercab, a driverless autonomous vehicle, at a closed-door event in Austin, Texas, marking a significant step toward commercializing driverless transportation. Meanwhile, Tesla has introduced an emergency drive-away feature that allows users to exit their vehicles while charging, offering quick assistance in the event of a mass shooting at a Supercharger location in Idaho.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Tesla will launch its Cybercab at a closed-door event in Austin, Texas, marking a significant step toward commercializing driverless transportation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Tesla introduced an emergency drive-away feature that allows users to exit their vehicles while charging, offering quick assistance in the event of a mass shooting at a Supercharger location in Idaho.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Tesla's Cybercab is expected to be available for sale at the event, with no pedals or steering wheel.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
