      "title": "Tesla will now let you drive off mid-charge if there’s an emergency",
      "link": "https://www.theverge.com/transportation/1003967/tesla-charging-breakaway-emergency-shooting",
      "description": "Tesla introduced a new feature to enable drivers to escape quickly while charging their vehicles in response to a mass shooting at a Supercharger location in Idaho in August that left seven people wounded and four dead. When a Tesla vehicle is charging, the plug is locked to the charging port and driving is disabled. [&#8230;]",
      "source_name": "The Verge All Posts",
      "published": "2026-10-02T14:34:14"
    },
    {
      "title": "Tesla rolls out an emergency drive-away feature after Supercharger shooting",
      "link": "https://www.engadget.com/2275509/tesla-supercharger-emergency-drive-away-feature/",
      "description": "Tesla's new feature will let you drive away with the Supercharger still connected in case of emergencies.",
